{"thread":{"threadID":4008,"boardID":166,"topic":"Jail + Knife Maps","time":1481988266,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","lastPostTime":1482170185,"lastPoster":"Nachtfrische","replies":24,"views":997,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":2},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":55675,"threadID":4008,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"Jail + Knife Maps","time":1481988266,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":2,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2287,"username":"Krokoblack","time":1481988975,"value":1},{"userID":1998,"username":"aXaX.","time":1482324184,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hallo Dream,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>hier mal wieder ein paar Maps für den Jails Server und auch ein paar für den Knife Server.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Jail :</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Entfernt : jb_nutella_candy</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Neu :<br>ba_jail_closed_v3<br>jb_atomic_jail_beta4_fix2<br>jb_coast_v2b<br>jb_deco_snow_final2<br>jb_lotus_v2<br>jb_mansion<br>jb_waterside_v5_1</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Knife :</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Neu :<br>35hp_[RS]_2<br>35hp_aztecdagger<br>35hp_galaxy_ring<br>35hp_nano_up<br>35hp_snow_night_v2f</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Hier der Download <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1-sky/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Sky</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1253-blackfire/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@BlackFire</a> <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a> :  <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/569vmvbmq12weqg/Jail%20Meps.7z?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Jail Maps</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/d2ev9cnokysjqh4/Knife%20Meps.7z?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Knife Maps</a></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wie immer könnt ihr Feedback da lassen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Mit freundlichen Grüßen ifZ4ne</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55677,"threadID":4008,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1481989209,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wie immer gute Arbeit.<br>waterside hört sich Viel versprechend an.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55680,"threadID":4008,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1481990009,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Vor allem sollte man die jb_paper_alive_ultime_se rausnehmen aus dem Grund das man dort ganz einfach den Server abstürzen lassen kann. Zu deinem Vorschlag hört sich alles gut an und ausprobieren kann man die Maps ja <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55681,"threadID":4008,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1481990729,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Phil mein Herz, kannst du mal schnell &quot;jb_dust_final&quot; testen und gegebenenfalls hinzufügen? Gab nen map update... love you  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55682,"threadID":4008,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1481990769,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Schockly</strong></cite><p>Vor allem sollte man die jb_paper_alive_ultime_se rausnehmen aus dem Grund das man dort ganz einfach den Server abstürzen lassen kann. Zu deinem Vorschlag hört sich alles gut an und ausprobieren kann man die Maps ja <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span> <br></p></blockquote><p>Paper ist nicht die einzige Map wo man das einfach kann, gibt viele Maps wo man das einfach kann, wer es beabsichtigt macht wird sowieso gebannt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>wickedy</strong></cite><p>Phil mein Herz, kannst du mal schnell &quot;jb_dust_final&quot; testen und gegebenenfalls hinzufügen? Gab nen map update... love you  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">❤️</span><br></p></blockquote><p>Hatte ich schon beim vor letzten vorschlag drinne (?) glaube ich. Funktioniert irgendwie nicht auf dem Server dunno why</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55684,"threadID":4008,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1481991461,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>sadface.png</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55685,"threadID":4008,"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","subject":"","time":1481991517,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>ich habe auch paar <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/184618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/192196\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a> für jail</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55686,"threadID":4008,"userID":2106,"username":"ifZ4ne","subject":"","time":1481991608,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","time":1481991674,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Ibo107</strong></cite><p>ich habe auch paar <a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/184618\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a><a href=\"http://gamebanana.com/maps/192196\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\"></a> für jail<br></p></blockquote><p>Map 1 : Viel zu groß, habe die getestet, außerdem hat sie ein komplett eigenes Konzept, auf der Map müsste eine runde mind 30 minuten gehen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Map 2 : Crasht den Server</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55687,"threadID":4008,"userID":2185,"username":"Ibo107","subject":"","time":1481991699,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>aso ok</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55689,"threadID":4008,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1481992844,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Schaue mir dir Maps morgen an und werde die dann auch draufmachen, danke für den Vorschlag  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55691,"threadID":4008,"userID":2165,"username":"O.E.","subject":"","time":1481992869,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>süper</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55692,"threadID":4008,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1481993833,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1482010027,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Schaue mir dir Maps morgen an und werde die dann auch draufmachen, danke für den Vorschlag <span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br></p></blockquote><p>*Die *Hinzufügen <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span> Ich freue mich schon auf die neuen Maps!</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>NP Nachti <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55712,"threadID":4008,"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","subject":"","time":1482001756,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[disli-ke*]</span> 35hp_[RS]_2 : NO, it&#x27;s just like 35hp_oldschool just other textures<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[like*]</span> 35hp_aztecdagger : Hm...why not<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[disli-ke*]</span> 35hp_galaxy_ring : NO, I think we got enough ring arena maps tbh (2 maps lego and $2000$ boxing wich is getting edit<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[like*]</span> 35hp_nano_up : Yeah looks kinda cool<br> <span class=\"missing-media\">[disli-ke*]</span> 35hp_snow_night_v2f : NO, We kinda have this map already also so</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>(This is just my opinion)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55777,"threadID":4008,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1482096319,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2229,"username":"WHAT","time":1482102366,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Die folgenden <u>Jail Maps</u> wurden nun hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>jb_atomic_jail_beta4_fix2</li>\n<li>jb_coast_v2b</li>\n<li>jb_deco_snow_final2</li>\n<li>jb_lotus_v2</li>\n<li>jb_mansion</li>\n<li>jb_waterside_v5_1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Als kleines Extra wurde auch noch jb_dust2_final2 hinzugefügt <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Entfernt wurden:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>jb_nutella_candy</li>\n<li>ba_minecraft_2015</li>\n</ul>\n<p>_____________________________________________________________________________________<br>Folgende <u>Knife Maps</u> wurden hinzugefügt:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>35hp_nano_up</li>\n<li>\n35hp_snow_night_v2b wurde durch 35hp_snow_night_v2f ersetzt</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke an <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2106-ifz4ne/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@ifZ4ne</a> für den erneuten Vorschlag.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55778,"threadID":4008,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1482097078,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Good Job.<br>Die Dust 2 Map hab ich ja mit Ibo und anderen Leuten bisschen erkundet, echt geile map.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55779,"threadID":4008,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1482097241,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1482172531,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Warum wurde die Map ba_minecraft_2015 entfernt?<br>Sie war sehr unterhaltsam, vorallem mit dem BHOP.  <span class=\"missing-media\">[;(]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55786,"threadID":4008,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1482100798,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich stimme Cyber zu.<br>Das Bhop auf dieser Map war herausfordernd und hat Spaß gemacht + Man konnte Messer für andere Leute hinlegen, falls sie kein schönes/garkeins haben.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55793,"threadID":4008,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1482105249,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich bin sehr stark gegen die Entfernung dieser Map!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55794,"threadID":4008,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1482106382,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Find ich voll toppo <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55795,"threadID":4008,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1482106400,"lastEditTime":1482170217,"editCount":2,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[{"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","time":1482129848,"value":1},{"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","time":1482136205,"value":1},{"userID":1955,"username":"Zmirk","time":1482172645,"value":1},{"userID":2151,"username":"Saitama","time":1482248465,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>ba_minecraft_2015 wurde wieder eingefügt.<br><s></s><br><s>Ebenso wurde &quot;<em>mp_drop_knife_enable</em>&quot; auf &quot;1&quot; gestellt, heißt, es nun möglich, sein Knife auf jeder Map an andere Spieler zu droppen.</s> EDIT: Funktion wurde wieder rausgenommen</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Danke für das Feedback.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55796,"threadID":4008,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1482106526,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Auch voll töfte <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😄</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55797,"threadID":4008,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1482108763,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Das man sein Knife auf allen maps droppen kann ja mega geil haha.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55798,"threadID":4008,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1482129838,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Yay, danke <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/1825-nachtfrische/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Nachtfrische</a>!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55805,"threadID":4008,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1482153013,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>Nachtfrische</strong></cite><p>Ebenso wurde &quot;<em>mp_drop_knife_enable</em>&quot; auf &quot;1&quot; gestellt, heißt, es nun möglich, sein Knife auf jeder Map an andere Spieler zu droppen.<br></p></blockquote><p>Wenn man sein Knife dropped kann man es nicht mehr aufheben pls fix.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":55829,"threadID":4008,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1482170185,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>NekoCedx3</strong></cite><p>Wenn man sein Knife dropped kann man es nicht mehr aufheben pls fix.<br></p></blockquote><p>Es gibt wohl Probleme mit anderen Plugins, weswegen diese Funktion leider auf dem Jail nicht korrekt funktioniert.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Das Feature wird folgedessen wieder entfernt.</p>","polls":[]}]}